(1) photon: max |M(h) shat| / |M| over 200 random (h, p) = 7.5e-16  (exact U(1) invariance with metric)
(2) fermion Pi_mu_nu(0) (per naive fermion, m=0.3, L=24): max |.| = 1.5e-04; separate pieces are O(1e-1)
(3) W(B4) covariance of fermion bilinear: max rel dev over 6 random elements = 4.5e-15
(4) evenness: max |B(q) - B(-q)| / |B| = 4.9e-16
